PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T22:27:31-07:00","id":1449320,"title":"","content":"Something I\u2019ve seen a couple sheets now are boxes to mark which Skills are Path Skills, but other than spending the Path increases, does this serve a purpose? You\u2019d still have to reference the Path if you raised your Path score because the check boxes wouldn\u2019t differentiate between the different Paths, right? Or am I missing something else?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1885-crackedman","name":"CrackedMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T22:42:49-07:00","id":1449322,"title":"","content":"I love your sheet and I have some corrections / suggestions.<br /> <br /> - Defense score is 1, the resistance attribute is rolled when you take defensive actions. The sheet in the book has this badly noted too.<br /> <br /> - Quantum Points would benefit from a Max / Current spaces<br /> <br /> - The first couple lines for the Injury Conditions extends into the modifier.<br /> <br /> - The placement of the Hard Armor might be better centered or stretched to fill the width.<br /> <br /> - As the Flux trait is a temporary one, boxes would be better as dots usually indicate you can roll a trait. (Unless I missed somewhere that Flux gets rolled)<br /> <br /> - The colons after Skills are unneeded and I\u2019m unsure what the boxes are for.<br /> <br /> - Moment of Inspiration, might be better as Moment of Eruption, as Inspiration is a Talents thing<br /> <br /> - The space for Quantum powers is cramped, not sure the best way to help with that, but I believe the \u201cMin\u201d space is unneeded except when raising the power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1885-crackedman","name":"CrackedMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T23:17:40-07:00","id":1449324,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrackedMan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325818-fan-made-character-sheets-merged?p=1449320#post1449320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Something I\u2019ve seen a couple sheets now are boxes to mark which Skills are Path Skills, but other than spending the Path increases, does this serve a purpose? You\u2019d still have to reference the Path if you raised your Path score because the check boxes wouldn\u2019t differentiate between the different Paths, right? Or am I missing something else?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd suggest putting the number of your Path in the box, so you know which are to which Paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />\u200bWhen noise turns to silence, when colors dull and pale, when reality no longer makes sense, there shall you find me. There, in the dreams of the River of Faceless Millions, do I dwell.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/\" target=\"_blank\">http://harenm.deviantart.com/gallery/</a> for my art.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/378-haren","name":"haren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar378_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"664"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-23T10:04:09-07:00","id":1449354,"title":"","content":"The number? Like Origin is 1, Role is 2, Society is 3? But then if you take a 4th &amp; 5th path, how do you know which is which?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1885-crackedman","name":"CrackedMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T12:32:57-07:00","id":1449684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrackedMan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325818-fan-made-character-sheets-merged?p=1449322#post1449322\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I love your sheet and I have some corrections / suggestions.<br /> <br /> - Defense score is 1, the resistance attribute is rolled when you take defensive actions. The sheet in the book has this badly noted too.<br /> <br /> - Quantum Points would benefit from a Max / Current spaces<br /> <br /> - The first couple lines for the Injury Conditions extends into the modifier.<br /> <br /> - The placement of the Hard Armor might be better centered or stretched to fill the width.<br /> <br /> - As the Flux trait is a temporary one, boxes would be better as dots usually indicate you can roll a trait. (Unless I missed somewhere that Flux gets rolled)<br /> <br /> - The colons after Skills are unneeded and I\u2019m unsure what the boxes are for.<br /> <br /> - Moment of Inspiration, might be better as Moment of Eruption, as Inspiration is a Talents thing<br /> <br /> - The space for Quantum powers is cramped, not sure the best way to help with that, but I believe the \u201cMin\u201d space is unneeded except when raising the power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, I'll add your suggestions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T12:33:42-07:00","id":1449685,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CrackedMan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325818-fan-made-character-sheets-merged?p=1449354#post1449354\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The number? Like Origin is 1, Role is 2, Society is 3? But then if you take a 4th &amp; 5th path, how do you know which is which?</div> </div> </div> </div>I do O, R, and S.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12488-jeremysbrain","name":"Jeremysbrain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-26T20:51:59-07:00","id":1449751,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jeremysbrain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1325818-fan-made-character-sheets-merged?p=1449685#post1449685\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I do O, R, and S.</div> </div> </div> </div>How would you handle if someone took a 4th and 5th role that don\u2019t have a clear slot like that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1885-crackedman","name":"CrackedMan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1885_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"254"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-27T00:24:25-07:00","id":1449768,"title":"","content":"The paths are interchangeable, for example, the son of a Aeon employee that grew up in those buildings and having contact with other Aeon employees can pick Aeon Society as Origin Path instead of Society Path. As long there is a good ex